SUMMARY:Astrology  Workshop: Timeline Your Life
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nJoin us in a discussionthat reflects upon
  the major astrological moments in your life.\nDuring this workshop we wil
 l explore the transits and pivotal astrological moments that occur within 
 your lifetime. Our astrology workshops always intertwine learning with gro
 up reflection and discussion.\n***Note***: Bring your chart if you have it
  or we can help when you arrive. Birth times are not required but always e
 ncouraged for more personal accuracy.\n\nJenn has been a practicing Astrol
 oger for 8+ years and offers Astrology readings online and in Asheville\n\
 n*Donation Event $ recommended $15 - $30 per person*
