SUMMARY:Tarot Practice!
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**Tarot & Pendulum Practice – All Level
 s Welcome!**\n\n**Come explore\, learn\, and practice Tarot and pendulum r
 eading in a relaxed\, friendly\, and supportive environment!**\n\n**Whethe
 r you’re completely new to Tarot or have been reading cards for years\, 
 this gathering is an opportunity to develop your skills\, build confidence
 \, and share experiences with others.**\n\n**We’ll begin with a brief 20
 -minute introduction to Tarot\, covering the basics and answering question
 s. Then we’ll spend most of our time practicing together!**\n\n**What to
  expect:**\n\n* **Practice giving and receiving Tarot readings.**\n* **Exp
 lore different Tarot card spreads and interpretations.**\n* **Experiment w
 ith pendulums and their uses.**\n* **Share insights\, experiences\, and te
 chniques with fellow participants.**\n* **Learn from one another in a welc
 oming\, judgment-free setting.**\n\n**No experience or equipment necessary
 ! We’ll have extra Tarot decks and pendulums available for anyone who ne
 eds them. Everyone will have an opportunity to participate in a reading.**
 \n\n**This is a hands-on gathering focused on learning through practice\, 
 connecting with others\, and having fun. Bring your curiosity\, your quest
 ions\, and your favorite deck or pendulum if you have one!**\n\n**All leve
 ls welcome. Come and practice!**\n\n**See you there!**\n\n**Shaman Phil**
