SUMMARY:Hand Drum Building Class
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nCreate your own **10" rawhide hand drum**
  in this hands-on\, small-group workshop blending traditional drum making 
 with intention and gratitude.\n\nWe’ll begin with an introduction to the
  drum’s role in shamanic practice\, set a personal intention\, and then 
 guide you step-by-step through stretching\, lacing\, and creating your own
  drum. We’ll close with a guided gratitude meditation honoring the natur
 al materials and the journey of creating something meaningful with your ow
 n hands.\n\n**No experience necessary. All materials are included\, and yo
 u’ll leave with a handcrafted drum that is uniquely yours.**
