SUMMARY:Sun Circle: Sagittarius Season
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nWhen the sun moves into a new sign an ene
 rgetic shift occurs. Learning to connect\, listen\, and set intentions wit
 h the sun is a beautiful way to add ritual into your life.\n\nSagittarius 
 season is from 11/22 - 12/20 and for this gathering we'll discuss the Astr
 ological happenings of the zodiac season and where it will impact you pers
 onally (birth chart recommended not required).\n\nAs with all energetic sh
 ifts\, getting into your body is important. Together we'll ground into the
  energy through meditation and somatic movement themed around the season.\
 nAccommodations/Modification will be made for ALL bodies\, come as you are
 .\nWe'll close out with time for journaling and optional sharing.\n\n***Br
 ing:***\nComfortable clothes to move in\nJournal and pen\nBirth chart if y
 ou have it\nwater bottle\n\n***Cash \\|\\| Venmo \\|\\| Card are all accep
 ted at the door also***
