SUMMARY:Full Moon Ceremony (Virtual)
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**Coming Home to Yourself**\n\n**A Beaver
  Moon Ceremony & Soul Retrieval Journey**\n\n**Join us on November 24 for 
 a full moon ceremony centered on gratitude\, inner connection\, and welcom
 ing home the parts of ourselves that are ready to return.**\n\n**As nature
  prepares for winter\, the Beaver Moon offers an opportunity to consider w
 hat sustains us and how we create a sense of safety and belonging within o
 urselves.**\n\n**During our gathering\, I will lead a guided shamanic soul
  retrieval journey. In this spiritual practice\, we invite reconnection wi
 th aspects of ourselves that may feel distant—our joy\, confidence\, cre
 ativity\, trust\, or sense of purpose.**\n\n**We will begin with grounding
  and intention\, then journey to an inner sanctuary where we will invite a
  compassionate guide or spirit animal to accompany us. From there\, we wil
 l gently explore what is ready to be welcomed home and what it needs to fe
 el supported. We will save a few minutes for intention setting and cord cu
 tting.**\n\n**Our guiding question will be:**\n\n**“What part of me is r
 eady to come home\, and how can I make room for it?”**\n\n**There is no 
 need to force an experience or revisit painful memories. You may experienc
 e the journey through images\, feelings\, words\, or quiet reflection. You
  are welcome to approach it spiritually or symbolically and participate at
  your own pace.**\n\n**All experience levels are welcome. Please have wate
 r and a journal available\, and anything that helps you feel comfortable d
 uring meditation.**\n\n**We will close with gratitude then have time for o
 ptional sharing.**\n\n**I look forward to sharing this journey with you.**
 \n\n**Shaman Phil**
